    title: "[Clinical & Regulatory Lane + Early-Precancer Microenvironment + Paired Normal-Mucosa-With-Polyp scRNA-seq + Four Conserved Hallmarks of Polypogenesis + CD55-ADGRE5 / MIF-CD74 / GZMA-PARD3 Intercellular Axes] GSE327909 'Single-cell atlas reveals shared early microenvironmental remodeling in colorectal polypogenesis' (Homo sapiens, score 6, n=6 samples from 3 patients, 31,147 high-quality cells, pdat 2026/10/31 = FRESHEST NOVEL accession band of the day, raw MTX + TSV, license NCBI public repository, query 'colorectal polyp') is the FIRST NOVEL pre-malignant microenvironment atlas of the day; [AI Drug Discovery Lane + Transcription-Factor-to-lncRNA-to-Coactivator Chain + KLF16 Master Regulator + SIN3A Physical Interaction + CTD-2377D24.6 Downstream Mediator + In-Vivo Growth Interdiction] GSE349296 'KLF16 and SIN3A facilitate endometrial cancer cell proliferation in association with CTD-2377D24.6' (Homo sapiens, score 6, n=6, pdat 2026/10/31 = FRESHEST NOVEL accession band of the day, raw XLSX, license NCBI public repository, query 'colorectal polyp') is the FIRST NOVEL three-node TF-lncRNA-coactivator intervention chain of the day; [AI Drug Discovery Lane + Biotech Infrastructure + Low-Input Nascent-RNA Sequencing Method + One-Step 5-BrU Immunopurification + ~500 ng Total RNA / ~25,000 Cells Genome-Wide + Transcriptional-Kinetics Reference Resource] GSE313015 'Li-BrU-seq: A Low-Input and Simplified Metabolic Labeling Method for Nascent RNA Sequencing' (Homo sapiens, score 6, n=10, pdat 2026/10/21, raw BW, license NCBI public repository, PMID 41773915, doi:10.1021/acschembio.5c01011, ACS Chemical Biology) is the FIRST NOVEL low-input nascent-transcriptome method resource of the day",
